{
 "to patch their wounds": "为了包扎伤口",
 "to shore up their armor": "为了加固护甲",
 "for the chest": "为了宝箱",
 "to keep them in the fight": "为了让他们继续战斗",
 "{0} picks up the chest to keep it from the others.": "{0}捡起宝箱，不让别人拿到。",
 "The crowd above never sees the roads below.": "上面的观众永远看不到下面的路。",
 "{0} throws the Rete over {1}. It loses its movement next turn.": "{0}把Rete罩向{1}。它下个行动回合失去移动。",
 "Command {0}: move it, attack an adjacent enemy, or finish.": "指挥{0}：移动、攻击相邻敌人，或结束。",
 "{0} is walked to the gate first, arms raised to the crowd.": "{0}先被带到门口，向观众高举双臂。",
 "Handlers with nets and long poles herd the surviving beasts out through the beast gates.": "驯兽师拿着网和长杆，把幸存的野兽从兽门赶出去。",
 "Boatmen pole across the flooded arena, fishing out every token — some of them bite.": "船夫撑篙穿过被淹的竞技场，把每一个标记都捞上来——有些还会咬人。",
 "The sluices open: the sea drains out of the arena, corner to corner, and the sand comes back.": "水闸打开：海水从竞技场一角流到另一角排干，沙地重新露了出来。",
 "A hush falls. Through the Porta Libitinensis stalks a masked figure in <b>Charun's</b> likeness, a long iron hook in hand — come for <b>{0}</b>, as the Fates decreed.": "一片寂静。一个戴着<b>Charun</b>面具的身影手持长长的铁钩，从Porta Libitinensis缓步而来——按Fates的裁决，来带走<b>{0}</b>。",
 "{0} is dragged from the sand, hook under the arm, heels carving a line in the sand.": "{0}被铁钩勾住腋下拖离沙场，脚跟在沙上划出一道痕。",
 "Slaves wheel small carts onto the sand and heave the fallen aboard.": "奴隶们推着小车上了沙场，把倒下的人抬上去。",
 "Chained slaves shuffle across the sand with rags and rakes, wiping away the day’s blood.": "戴着镣铐的奴隶拿着破布和耙子拖着步子走过沙场，擦去这一天的血迹。",
 "Boys with baskets gather the laurels and flowers the crowd threw.": "男孩们提着篮子，捡起观众抛下的月桂和鲜花。",
 "The crew sweeps the sand for what the fighters left behind — dropped kit, offerings, thrown steel — every scrap carried to the vaults.": "工人们在沙场上搜寻斗士留下的东西——掉落的装备、祭品、投出的兵刃——每一件都被运进地下库房。",
 "The crews unstep the ships’ masts and drag them out — the sand is being set for Classic games.": "工人们卸下船桅拖走——沙场正在为经典比赛布置。",
 "The crew hauls away the stone that does not belong.": "工人们把不该在这里的石头运走。",
 "Teams of slaves carry out twelve pillars and set them on the Classic marks, fresh Blessings pots chained above.": "一队队奴隶抬出十二根柱子，立在经典比赛的位置上，顶上用链子挂好新的Blessings陶罐。",
 "Teams of slaves heave the fallen pillars back onto their plinths and chain fresh Blessings pots above.": "一队队奴隶把倒下的柱子抬回底座，并在顶上用链子挂好新的Blessings陶罐。",
 "Fresh Blessings pots are chained atop the pillars.": "新的Blessings陶罐被链子挂上柱顶。",
 "Below the sand, the winches turn: the spikes sink back into their housings.": "沙地下方，绞盘转动：尖刺缩回了机关里。",
 "The Arena Chest is carried back to its mark.": "Arena Chest被抬回原位。",
 "The ushers work the tiers: the last spectators drain out through the vomitoria, still arguing about the card.": "引座员在一层层看台间忙碌：最后一批观众从vomitoria散去，还在争论今天的对阵。",
 "Last of all, the handlers lead the beasts back in and walk them to their marks.": "最后，驯兽师把野兽领回场内，带到各自的位置。",
 "The games are done. The Porta Triumphalis opens for the living; the crew of the arena takes the sand.": "比赛结束了。Porta Triumphalis为生者打开；竞技场的工人接管了沙场。",
 "The sand is raked smooth, the ropes come down to open the full square, the pillars stand dressed, and the beast gates are barred. The arena waits for its next games.": "沙子被耙平，绳子撤下，整个场地完全敞开，柱子整装待命，兽门也已闩上。竞技场在等待下一场比赛。",
